flowchart LR
  User[User]

  subgraph Frontend[Frontend UI only]
    Manage[Manage Demo + SFTP Model<br/>no SFTP or DB credentials]
    ChatUI[Frontend Chat UI<br/>chat / step viewer / approvals]
  end

  subgraph Backend[Backend API / Trusted Scope]
    ChatAPI[Chat API / Protected Procedure<br/>schema + auth checks]
    Context[Agent Context Builder<br/>user / tenant / brand / KB / tool scope]
    Branches[Agent Branches<br/>RagAgent / SqlAgent / GeneralAgent / DemoAgent]
    Runtime[Agent Runtime Core<br/>orchestrator / memory / intent / skill catalog / agent loop]
    Policy[Unified Policy Gate<br/>args / permission / tenant-brand-KB scope / safety envelope]
    RAG[RAG Service<br/>grounded answer + citations]
    SQL[SQL Safety<br/>read-only / allowlist / row limit / timeout]
    ToolGate[Shared Tool Gate<br/>tool registry / schema / permission / approval / sanitization]
    Executor[Tool Executor / Tool Runner<br/>timeout / retry / abort / error mapping]
    SftpTools[SFTP Tool Groups<br/>read / write / destructive tools]
    SftpService[SFTP Service / Remote Demo Storage<br/>remote file/demo storage only]
    HITL[HITL Approval<br/>pending / approve / reject / history]
    Response[Response + Observability<br/>response normalize / step logs / audit logs / memory summary]
    Secrets[Secrets Manager / Backend Credentials<br/>backend only]

    subgraph Data[Data Layer / Persistence]
      AppDB[Application Database<br/>PostgreSQL / MySQL<br/>users / tenants / brands / roles / permissions / sessions / configs]
      VectorDB[Vector DB / Knowledge Store<br/>pgvector / Qdrant / Pinecone / Chroma<br/>documents / chunks / embeddings / metadata / citations]
      BusinessDB[Business / Report Database<br/>read-only / allowlist / row limit / timeout<br/>report / crawl / dashboard data]
      LogStore[Log / Audit Store<br/>step logs / audit logs / tool runs / policy decisions / errors]
    end
  end

  User --> Manage --> ChatUI --> ChatAPI --> Context --> Runtime --> Policy
  Branches --> Runtime
  ChatAPI --> AppDB
  Context --> AppDB
  Runtime --> AppDB
  Policy --> AppDB

  Policy --> RAG --> VectorDB
  Policy --> SQL --> BusinessDB
  Policy --> ToolGate --> Executor --> SftpTools --> SftpService
  Secrets -. backend credentials .-> SftpService

  ToolGate --> HITL
  Executor --> HITL
  HITL --> AppDB

  Runtime --> Response
  Policy --> Response
  ToolGate --> Response
  Executor --> Response
  Response --> ChatUI
  Response --> AppDB
  Response --> LogStore
  Policy --> LogStore
  ToolGate --> LogStore
  Executor --> LogStore

